OL,3,CUrgent appeal to find missing man who
OL,4,C'may have contagious condition'
OL,6,FCCTV shows missing man Dean Hesketh
OL,7,Fwho was last seen leaving Royal
OL,8,FPreston Hospital.
OL,10,FPolice are appealing for the public's
OL,11,Fhelp to trace a man who went missing
OL,12,Ffrom a hospital - and "may have
OL,13,Fcontagious condition".
OL,15,FCCTV released by Lancashire Police
OL,16,Fshows masked Dean Hesketh leaving
OL,17,FRoyal Preston Hospital at 11.16am on
OL,18,F28 July.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
