PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785511094
OL,3,CUrgent appeal to find missing man who
OL,4,C'may have contagious condition'
OL,6,FOfficers say enquiries to find him are
OL,7,Fongoing as they grow "increasingly
OL,8,Fconcerned" for his safety and welfare.
OL,10,FThey have described Dean, who also
OL,11,Fuses the names Tim and Anthony
OL,12,FGledhill, as slim, 5ft 4in with black
OL,13,Fhair and blue eyes.
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old was last seen wearing
OL,16,Fa khaki green and black jacket, a Lyle
OL,17,Fand Scott jumper, black trainers, and
OL,18,Fa blue surgical face mask.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
