OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785511094
OL,3,CUrgent appeal to find missing man who
OL,4,C'may have contagious condition'
OL,6,FIt is understood he also has strong
OL,7,Flinks to Preston, Penwortham, and
OL,8,FBlackpool.
OL,10,FMembers of the public are being warned
OL,11,Fnot to approach Dean if they spot him,
OL,12,Fas officers believe he may have a
OL,13,Fcontagious health condition.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the force said: "If
OL,16,Fyou do see Dean it's really important
OL,17,Fthat you get in touch with us on 999
OL,18,Fas soon as you can, so that we can
OL,19,Fmake sure he is safe."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
